<title>NORWAY: Norske Skog 1996 results per division.</title>
<headline>Norske Skog 1996 results per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norske Skogindustrier ASA operating result per division for the 12 months to December 31.</p>
<p>		     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Paper				9,493     vs     8,066</p>
<p> Fibre				1,222     vs     2,171</p>
<p> Building materials	     2,579     vs     2,333</p>
<p> Total of areas		  13,294     vs    12,570</p>
<p> Eliminations/admin. costs	 29     vs	  22</p>
<p> Total consolidated	    13,265     vs    12,548</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
